## Title: Gildepanel
## Notes: The Addons window for THÖNDERSTÖRM (/gpanel): opens the other guild addons' windows and toggles their automatic settings. Also warns in chat 6 hours before your Skatteverket standing drops. Your tax itself is in Skatteverket's /skatt.
